  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Design of Empowerment and Accountability in Africa Programme is a component of Africa Regional Programme for Improved Empowerment and Accountability in Africa reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;70,700. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Democratic participation and civil society, Research/scientific institutions, Human rights.</narrative>
